import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.CuspCoinvariantExtensionPuncturedBasic
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.CuspCoinvariantExtensionPuncturedFlow
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.CuspCoinvariantExtensionPuncturedSpecial

/-!
# The genuine punctured cusp coinvariant

`CuspCoinvariantExtension.puncturedGamma` is continuous on the entire
original punctured cusp and equals the first real period coordinate
modulo integers on every original logarithmic-cover representative.
It is invariant under the original real vertical flow and agrees with
the original regular-family gamma through the actual special cusp
overlap and gluing inclusions. Extension across the central fibre is
not asserted by this package.
-/
